you can run it outside of [zone.js](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/c2efa23e94bf9ef3594bfa37aa30a0fc1dc2620a/modules/angular2/src/core/zone/ng_zone.ts#L130)

```
NgZone#runOutsideAngular(() => {
  requestAnimationFrame(() => console.log());
})
```

