issue.body:
When using a basic requestAnimationFrame render loop, the zone grows forever. 
Related to https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/2912

``` javascript
zone.fork().run(function () {
    function frameCallback() {
        // frame++
        requestAnimationFrame(frameCallback);
    }
    requestAnimationFrame(frameCallback);
});
```

Example: https://jsfiddle.net/9dqzky6g/3/
